entries[141033] = { ["name"] = "Technique: Glyph of the Crimson Shell", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nUnique\nUse: Teaches you how to craft a Glyph of the Crimson Shell.\nCraft a Glyph of the Crimson Shell.\nRequires Legion Inscription (1)\nSell Price:\nGlyph of the Crimson Shell\nClasses: Death Knight\nUse: Permanently teaches you this glyph.\n\nYour Anti-Magic Shell shifts to match more of a Blood affinity. Exclusive with: Glyph of the Chilled Shell\nSell Price:\nRequires Light Parchment , Sallow Pigment (10), Roseate Pigment (30)" }
